        "rating": 5,
        "text": "We have been using anteater since 2022 when we moved in. Shawn our service tech is such a nice guy. Hes always friendly and right on time. Anteater makes setting up services easy as well. Not to mention I havent seen a single critter since day 1 in our new home.",
